"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/72fb5fdd-629e-46c4-9654-1e1126641d45_1754714058667e2c5f2377e.jpg\" width=\"720\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/ce5eb949-5d44-4edf-be73-3952cac11367_2101311244667e2c5fac5ce.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"曾文心 反黑英雄 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/ce5eb949-5d44-4edf-be73-3952cac11367_2101311244667e2c5fac5ce.jpg\" width=\"720\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/1f1952d3-d54c-4856-a0ab-761fa00ac171_216580359667e2c6064277.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"曾文心 反黑英雄 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/1f1952d3-d54c-4856-a0ab-761fa00ac171_216580359667e2c6064277.jpg\" width=\"720\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/2bda9002-a939-456a-b3a6-625d69d4d6d0_880436212667e2c61760eb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"曾文心 反黑英雄 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/2bda9002-a939-456a-b3a6-625d69d4d6d0_880436212667e2c61760eb.jpg\" width=\"720\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/07d52f0b-7531-4bad-9cf3-9f66973162b3_1693777833667e2c6247377.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"曾文心 反黑英雄 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/07d52f0b-7531-4bad-9cf3-9f66973162b3_1693777833667e2c6247377.jpg\" width=\"720\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/e84a9647-33ae-4c64-9199-628663c38883_2107212687667e2c63230b3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"曾文心 反黑英雄 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/e84a9647-33ae-4c64-9199-628663c38883_2107212687667e2c63230b3.jpg\" width=\"720\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/070f4b02-2bed-42f8-ad8f-4c718561adaa_248294947667e2c63c9364.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"曾文心 反黑英雄 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/070f4b02-2bed-42f8-ad8f-4c718561adaa_248294947667e2c63c9364.jpg\" width=\"720\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T06:23:55.429046+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1654,"images":25,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T06:03:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T06:37:19.547028+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T06:17:20.448571+00:00","content_hash":"5043783bc5bc5aeea6cd4258b04e8b55596a24a8365757d03e6143f99e56f95b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}